          "method": "PATCH",
          "uri": "/cashback_rules/{id}",
          "code": 200
        },
        "smithy.api#documentation": "Update Cashback Rule\n\nUpdates a cashback rule funded by the authenticated platform account. Requires payout:transfer_funds. Only merchant_name, merchant_category_code, description, and expires_at can change; starts_at, rate_bps, funding_account_id, and scoped_account_id are immutable. Omitted fields stay unchanged. Scheduled, active, and expired rules can be updated; discarded rules cannot. Updating a rule does not transfer funds."
      }
